<p>Switch language, change colors, and select fonts to match your brand.</p><div class="d-flex "><div class="styles_buttonContainer__GmoiZ" data-sentry-component="ButtonContainer" data-sentry-source-file="ButtonContainer.tsx"><a id="425discoverTheCustomizeTool " class="text-nowrap link-arrow ms-0 my-1 me-1 " target="_self" data-sentry-element="CustomLink" data-sentry-component="ArrowLink" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx" href="/cloud/customize/"><span class="text-wrap">Discover the Customize tool</span> <svg class="link-arrow-svg ms-no5" version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" data-sentry-element="svg" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx"><path fill="currentColor" d="M8.578 16.594l4.594-4.594-4.594-4.594 1.406-1.406 6 6-6 6z" data-sentry-element="path" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div data-sentry-element="Col" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx" class="text-center text-md-start col-md-6 order-md-last order-first"><img style="width:100%;height:auto" width="1382" height="855" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 75vw, 50vw" src="https://media.maptiler.com/img/maptiler_customize_3706e8a16b.png" srcSet="https://media.maptiler.com/img/xsmall_maptiler_customize_3706e8a16b.png 125w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/thumbnail_maptiler_customize_3706e8a16b.png 245w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/small_maptiler_customize_3706e8a16b.png 450w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/medium_maptiler_customize_3706e8a16b.png 750w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/large_maptiler_customize_3706e8a16b.png 1000w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/xlarge_maptiler_customize_3706e8a16b.png 1250w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/maptiler_customize_3706e8a16b.png 1450w" alt="MapTiler Cloud customize" class=" rounded"/></div></div></div><div class="fade-in" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)" data-sentry-component="FadeIn" data-sentry-source-file="FadeIn.tsx"><div id="222content_Block" data-sentry-element="Row" data-sentry-component="ContentBlock" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx" class="justify-content-center justify-content-md-between align-items-center my-md-12 my-4 row"><div data-sentry-element="Col" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx" class="text-start col-md-5"><h2>Bring your spatial data to life</h2><p>Publish your spatial data with no manual steps or setup required. Just drag and drop raster or vector files, or upload them via API.</p>
<p>Formats such as GeoTIFF, GeoJSON, and Shapefile are processed automatically and are ready to go live in a matter of moments.</p><div class="d-flex "><div class="styles_buttonContainer__GmoiZ" data-sentry-component="ButtonContainer" data-sentry-source-file="ButtonContainer.tsx"><a id="426learnMore" class="text-nowrap link-arrow ms-0 my-1 me-1 " target="_self" data-sentry-element="CustomLink" data-sentry-component="ArrowLink" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx" href="/cloud/geodata-hosting/"><span class="text-wrap">Learn more</span> <svg class="link-arrow-svg ms-no5" version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" data-sentry-element="svg" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx"><path fill="currentColor" d="M8.578 16.594l4.594-4.594-4.594-4.594 1.406-1.406 6 6-6 6z" data-sentry-element="path" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div data-sentry-element="Col" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx" class="text-center text-md-start col-md-6 order-md-first order-first"><div><div class="bg-white  iframed rounded" data-sentry-component="VimeoPlayer" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx"><img class="vimeo-thumbnail" src="https://i.vimeocdn.com/video/2042535359-77cf1806fe72b903238188bbe973c50159f6d239c41c21054f53dd0515a1676f-d_295x166?region=us" alt="Vimeo Thumbnail"/><iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1105905516?background=1&amp;byline=0&amp;title=0&amp;vimeo_logo=0&amp;portrait=0" width="100%" height="100%" allow="autoplay; autopause; fullscreen; picture-in-picture; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; web-share" allowFullScreen="" title="Vimeo Video Player"></iframe></div></div></div></div></div><div class="fade-in" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)" data-sentry-component="FadeIn" data-sentry-source-file="FadeIn.tsx"><div id="224content_Block" data-sentry-element="Row" data-sentry-component="ContentBlock" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx" class="justify-content-center justify-content-md-between align-items-center my-md-12 my-4 row"><div data-sentry-element="Col" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx" class="text-start col-md-5"><h2>Edit your data</h2><p>Add points, lines, &amp; polygons and annotate in a few clicks.</p>
<p>Add directly to your map and use it on your web or mobile app via API.</p><div class="d-flex "><div class="styles_buttonContainer__GmoiZ" data-sentry-component="ButtonContainer" data-sentry-source-file="ButtonContainer.tsx"><a id="427discoverEditTool " class="text-nowrap link-arrow ms-0 my-1 me-1 " target="_self" data-sentry-element="CustomLink" data-sentry-component="ArrowLink" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx" href="/cloud/edit-geodata/"><span class="text-wrap">Discover Edit tool</span> <svg class="link-arrow-svg ms-no5" version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" data-sentry-element="svg" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx"><path fill="currentColor" d="M8.578 16.594l4.594-4.594-4.594-4.594 1.406-1.406 6 6-6 6z" data-sentry-element="path" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div data-sentry-element="Col" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx" class="text-center text-md-start col-md-6 order-md-last order-first"><img style="width:100%;height:auto" width="570" height="321" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 75vw, 50vw" src="https://media.maptiler.com/img/vector_data_editor_1_8dfbfefc8a.webp" srcSet="https://media.maptiler.com/img/xsmall_vector_data_editor_1_8dfbfefc8a.webp 125w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/thumbnail_vector_data_editor_1_8dfbfefc8a.webp 245w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/small_vector_data_editor_1_8dfbfefc8a.webp 450w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/vector_data_editor_1_8dfbfefc8a.webp 650w" alt="MapTiler image vector-data-editor-1.webp" class=" rounded"/></div></div></div><div class="fade-in" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)" data-sentry-component="FadeIn" data-sentry-source-file="FadeIn.tsx"><div id="225content_Block" data-sentry-element="Row" data-sentry-component="ContentBlock" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx" class="justify-content-center justify-content-md-between align-items-center my-md-12 my-4 row"><div data-sentry-element="Col" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx" class="text-start col-md-5"><h2>Search &amp; Geocoding</h2><p>API for the transformation of place names and addresses to geographical coordinates and vice versa.</p>
<p>Find any place on Earth (states, cities, streets down to the address level etc.) or get a place name for your coordinates.</p><div class="d-flex "><div class="styles_buttonContainer__GmoiZ" data-sentry-component="ButtonContainer" data-sentry-source-file="ButtonContainer.tsx"><a id="428discoverGeocoding " class="text-nowrap link-arrow ms-0 my-1 me-1 " target="_self" data-sentry-element="CustomLink" data-sentry-component="ArrowLink" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx" href="/cloud/geocoding/"><span class="text-wrap">Discover geocoding</span> <svg class="link-arrow-svg ms-no5" version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" data-sentry-element="svg" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx"><path fill="currentColor" d="M8.578 16.594l4.594-4.594-4.594-4.594 1.406-1.406 6 6-6 6z" data-sentry-element="path" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div data-sentry-element="Col" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx" class="text-center text-md-start col-md-6 order-md-first order-first"><img style="width:100%;height:auto" width="1080" height="808" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 75vw, 50vw" src="https://media.maptiler.com/img/geocoding_header_3338fa3f07.webp" srcSet="https://media.maptiler.com/img/xsmall_geocoding_header_3338fa3f07.webp 125w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/thumbnail_geocoding_header_3338fa3f07.webp 209w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/small_geocoding_header_3338fa3f07.webp 450w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/medium_geocoding_header_3338fa3f07.webp 750w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/large_geocoding_header_3338fa3f07.webp 1000w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/geocoding_header_3338fa3f07.webp 1200w" alt="MapTiler image geocoding-header.webp" class=" rounded"/></div></div></div><div class="fade-in" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)" data-sentry-component="FadeIn" data-sentry-source-file="FadeIn.tsx"><div class="my-4 my-md-12" data-sentry-component="TextCards" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx"><div data-sentry-element="Row" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx" class="justify-content-around row"></div><div data-sentry-element="Row" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx" class="justify-content-stretch  row"><div class="text-center my-2 col-xl-3 col-md-6"><div class="bg-lighter rounded h-100 d-flex flex-column justify-content-between"><div class="px-4 pt-3"><h4>Static maps API</h4><p>Display maps as static images to reduce load on your pages.</p></div><div class=""><div class="me-sm-0 mb-2"><a class="btn btn-primary   " id="429staticMapsApi" target="_self" href="/cloud/static-maps/">Static maps API</a></div><img style="width:100%;height:auto" width="541" height="304" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 75vw, 50vw" src="https://media.maptiler.com/img/markers_1117aad9df.webp" srcSet="https://media.maptiler.com/img/xsmall_markers_1117aad9df.webp 125w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/thumbnail_markers_1117aad9df.webp 245w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/small_markers_1117aad9df.webp 450w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/markers_1117aad9df.webp 650w" alt="static maps api with pins" class="rounded-bottom"/></div></div></div><div class="text-center my-2 col-xl-3 col-md-6"><div class="bg-lighter rounded h-100 d-flex flex-column justify-content-between"><div class="px-4 pt-3"><h4>API for web &amp; mobile</h4><p>Use raster tiles with Leaflet, OpenLayers, or XYZ, vector tiles with MapTiler SDK, or WMTS for QGIS or ArcGIS.</p></div><div class=""><div class="me-sm-0 mb-2"><a class="btn btn-primary   " id="430apiDocumentation " target="_self" href="https://docs.maptiler.com/cloud/api/" rel="noopener" data-sentry-component="CustomLink" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx">API Documentation           </a></div><img style="width:100%;height:auto" width="1080" height="608" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 75vw, 50vw" src="https://media.maptiler.com/img/devices_6c2e9d69bb.webp" srcSet="https://media.maptiler.com/img/xsmall_devices_6c2e