ud/geoip/">IP Geolocation API</a></div><img style="width:100%;height:auto" width="1090" height="608" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 75vw, 50vw" src="https://media.maptiler.com/img/ip_geolocation_api_dd5fa7927c.webp" srcSet="https://media.maptiler.com/img/xsmall_ip_geolocation_api_dd5fa7927c.webp 125w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/thumbnail_ip_geolocation_api_dd5fa7927c.webp 245w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/small_ip_geolocation_api_dd5fa7927c.webp 450w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/medium_ip_geolocation_api_dd5fa7927c.webp 750w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/large_ip_geolocation_api_dd5fa7927c.webp 1000w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/ip_geolocation_api_dd5fa7927c.webp 1200w" alt="IP Geolocation API service" class="rounded-bottom"/></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-sentry-element="Row" data-sentry-component="RecentNews" data-sentry-source-file="index.tsx" class="my-4 my-md-12 row"><div class="fade-in" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)" data-sentry-component="FadeIn" data-sentry-source-file="FadeIn.tsx"><div class="text-center my-2 mb-sm-6 col-12"><h2>Read latest news about Cloud</h2></div></div><div class="my-2 col-lg-4 col-sm-6"><div class="fade-in" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)" data-sentry-component="FadeIn" data-sentry-source-file="FadeIn.tsx"><a href="/news/2025/10/new-generation-of-maptiler-maps/"><img style="width:100%;height:auto" width="1600" height="900" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 75vw, 50vw" src="https://media.maptiler.com/img/2025_10_21_new_generation_fo_maptiler_maps_6_0839f1d5af.webp" srcSet="https://media.maptiler.com/img/xsmall_2025_10_21_new_generation_fo_maptiler_maps_6_0839f1d5af.webp 125w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/thumbnail_2025_10_21_new_generation_fo_maptiler_maps_6_0839f1d5af.webp 245w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/small_2025_10_21_new_generation_fo_maptiler_maps_6_0839f1d5af.webp 450w, https://media.maptiler.com/img/medium_2025_10_21_new_generation_