loud\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-16T07:35:33.113Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-17T13:02:40.219Z\"}}]},\"localizations\":{\"data\":[]}}},{\"id\":121,\"attributes\":{\"shortName\":\"The beauty of our planet from space\",\"slug\":\"2018/06/the-beauty-of-our-planet-from-space\",\"type\":\"article\",\"tags\":\"openmaptiles,maps,cloud\",\"date\":\"2018-06-27\",\"description\":\"Cloudless satellite imagery for the whole world.\",\"createdAt\":\"2023-10-05T14:56:24.224Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2023-11-03T14:00:34.940Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2023-10-05T14:56:28.985Z\",\"content\":\"$2e\",\"locale\":\"en\",\"thumbnail\":{\"data\":{\"id\":770,\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"2018-06-27-the-beauty-of-our-planet-from-space-1.jpg\",\"alternativeText\":\"Satellite map of the world\",\"caption\":null,\"width\":2048,\"height\":1152,\"formats\":{\"large\":{\"ext\":\".jpg\",\"url\":\"https://media.maptiler.com/img/large_2018_06_27_the_beauty_of_our_planet_from_space_1_4993ed2f34.jpg\",\"hash\":\"large_2018_06_27_the_beauty_of_our_planet_from_space_1_4993ed2f34\",\"mime\":\"image/jpeg\",\"name\":\"large_2018-06-27-the-beauty-of-our-planet-from-space-1.jpg\",\"path\":null,\"size\":152.84,\"width\":1000,\"height\":563},\"small\":{\"ext\":\".jpg\",\"url\":\"https://media.maptiler.com/img/small_2018_06_27_the_beauty_of_our_planet_from_space_1_4993ed2f34.jpg\",\"hash\":\"small_2018_06_27_the_beauty_of_our_planet_from_space_1_4993ed2f34\",\"mime\":\"image/jpeg\",\"name\":\"small_2018-06-27-the-beauty-of-our-planet-from-space-1.jpg\",\"path\":null,\"size\":45.45,\"width\":500,\"height\":281},\"medium\":{\"ext\":\".jpg\",\"url\":\"https://media.maptiler.com/img/medium_2018_06_27_the_beauty_of_our_planet_from_space_1_4993ed2f34.jpg\",\"hash\":\"medium_2018_06_27_the_beauty_of_our_planet_from_space_1_4993ed2f34\",\"mime\":\"image/jpeg\",\"name\":\"medium_2018-06-27-the-beauty-of-our-planet-from-space-1.jpg\",\"path\":null,\"size\":92.64,\"width\":750,\"height\":422},\"thumbnail\":{\"ext\":\".jpg\",\"url\":\"https://media.maptiler.com/img/thumbnail_2018_06_27_the_beauty_of_our_planet_from_space_1_4993ed2f34.jpg\",\"hash\":\"thumbnail_2018_06_27_the_beauty_of_our_planet_from_space_1_4993ed2f34\",\"mime\":\"image/jpeg\",\"name\":\"thumbnail_2018-06-27-the-beauty-of-our-planet-from-space-1.jpg\",\"path\":null,\"size\":13.29,\"width\":245,\"height\":138}},\"hash\":\"2018_06_27_the_beauty_of_our_planet_from_space_1_4993ed2f34\",\"ext\":\".jpg\",\"mime\":\"image/jpeg\",\"size\":501.7,\"url\":\"https://media.maptiler.com/img/2018_06_27_the_beauty_of_our_planet_from_space_1_4993ed2f34.jpg\",\"previewUrl\":null,\"provider\":\"aws-s3\",\"provider_metadata\":null,\"createdAt\":\"2023-10-05T14:53:30.499Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-01-15T16:09:57.351Z\"}}},\"newsContent\":[],\"author\":{\"data\":{\"id\":12,\"attributes\":{\"slug\":\"jiri-komarek\",\"name\":\"Jiri Komarek\",\"job\":\"Senior Technical Copywriter\",\"createdAt\":\"2023-09-22T11:24:27.549Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2023-09-22T11:24:28.708Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2023-09-22T11:24:28.701Z\",\"description\":\"Jiri is responsible for technical communication with clients. He is collecting information from engineers and transferring it into human-readable text on webpages, blog posts, and anywhere else. His activities include remote mapping for humanitarian purposes - which is connected to his education, where he got a degree in Humanitarian work. He is also a connection to the OpenStreetMap community, where he is a very active mapper.\\n\\nIn his spare time, Jiri loves to lose himself in the wild nature with his camera.\\n\\n[https://jirikomarek.net/](https://jirikomarek.net/)\",\"locale\":\"en\"}}},\"tagsRel\":{\"data\":[{\"id\":33,\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"openmaptiles\",\"slug\":\"openmaptiles\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-16T07:35:35.714Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-17T13:02:39.995Z\"}},{\"id\":23,\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"maps\",\"slug\":\"maps\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-16T07:35:35.032Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-17T13:02:40.162Z\"}},{\"id\":4,\"