f\",\"createdAt\":\"2023-09-22T09:50:08.578Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2023-09-22T11:16:47.589Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2023-09-22T09:50:09.922Z\",\"description\":\"MIKI (as his friends call him) is a developer of desktop applications, and his daily routine is to connect software functionality with a graphical user interface. After debugging, the most lovely job of every IT, he relaxes playing desk games with his friends or watching movies. In his spare evenings, MIKI plays floorball or drinks beer. He holds a master’s degree in informatics.\",\"locale\":\"en\"}}},\"tagsRel\":{\"data\":[{\"id\":20,\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"Desktop\",\"slug\":\"desktop\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-16T07:35:34.665Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-17T13:02:40.188Z\"}},{\"id\":4,\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"cloud\",\"slug\":\"cloud\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-16T07:35:33.113Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-17T13:02:40.219Z\"}}]},\"localizations\":{\"data\":[]}}},{\"id\":98,\"attributes\":{\"shortName\":\"Vector data editing in MapTiler Cloud\",\"slug\":\"2019/06/vector-data-editing-in-maptiler-cloud\",\"type\":\"article\",\"tags\":\"cloud,vector data editor\",\"date\":\"2019-06-06\",\"description\":\"New free vector data editor allows you to creating maps of your POIs, digitizing aerial maps, or creating thematic maps. \",\"createdAt\":\"2023-10-05T07:00:26.309Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-11-01T16:19:25.763Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2023-10-05T07:00:27.772Z\",\"content\":\"$3c\",\"locale\":\"en\",\"thumbnail\":{\"data\":{\"id\":695,\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"2019-06-06-vector-data-editing-in-maptiler-cloud-1.png\",\"alternativeText\":\"Add points, lines, and polygons to your map\",\"caption\":null,\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080,\"formats\":{\"large\":{\"ext\":\".png\",\"url\":\"https://media.maptiler.com/img/large_2019_06_06_vector_data_editing_in_maptiler_cloud_1_34927356f8.png\",\"hash\":\"large_2019_06_06_vector_data_editing_in_maptiler_cloud_1_34927356f8\",\"mime\":\"image/png\",\"name\":\"large_2019-06-06-vector-data-e