k developer but is most active on the front-end. His responsibility is UX / UI design, and he likes coding with SASS. His experience also includes JavaScript, PHP, and Python. Dalibor has a master’s degree in GIS and takes care of cartography and geo health in the team.\\n\\nHis passion is mountains, speleology, and climbing.\",\"locale\":\"en\"}}},\"tagsRel\":{\"data\":[{\"id\":4,\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"cloud\",\"slug\":\"cloud\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-16T07:35:33.113Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-17T13:02:40.219Z\"}},{\"id\":3,\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"vector data editor\",\"slug\":\"vector-data-editor\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-16T07:35:33.092Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-17T13:02:36.629Z\"}}]},\"localizations\":{\"data\":[]}}},{\"id\":97,\"attributes\":{\"shortName\":\"New Pastel and Topographique map styles available on MapTiler Cloud\",\"slug\":\"2019/06/new-pastel-and-topographique-map-styles-available-on-maptiler-cloud\",\"type\":\"article\",\"tags\":\"maps,cloud\",\"date\":\"2019-06-10\",\"description\":\"Two new beautiful map styles - Topographique and Pastel - are available on MapTiler Cloud!\",\"createdAt\":\"2023-10-05T06:55:34.571Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2023-10-23T09:41:31.487Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2023-10-05T06:55:36.158Z\",\"content\":\"$3d\",\"locale\":\"en\",\"thumbnail\":{\"data\":{\"id\":693,\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"2019-06-10-new-pastel-and-topographique-map-styles-1.png\",\"alternativeText\":\"Pastel map\",\"caption\":null,\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080,\"formats\":{\"large\":{\"ext\":\".png\",\"url\":\"https://media.maptiler.com/img/large_2019_06_10_new_pastel_and_topographique_map_styles_1_3eef914174.png\",\"hash\":\"large_2019_06_10_new_pastel_and_topographique_map_styles_1_3eef914174\",\"mime\":\"image/png\",\"name\":\"large_2019-06-10-new-pastel-and-topographique-map-styles-1.png\",\"path\":null,\"size\":944.18,\"width\":1000,\"height\":563},\"small\":{\"ext\":\".png\",\"url\":\"https://media.maptiler.com/img/small_2019_06_10_new_pastel_and_to