_08_high_resolution_aerial_imagery_of_entire_japan_1_159e093548.jpg\",\"previewUrl\":null,\"provider\":\"aws-s3\",\"provider_metadata\":null,\"createdAt\":\"2023-10-04T13:43:49.210Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-01-15T20:17:03.419Z\"}}},\"newsContent\":[],\"author\":{\"data\":{\"id\":9,\"attributes\":{\"slug\":\"dalibor-janak\",\"name\":\"Dalibor Janak\",\"job\":\"Senior Product Manager \u0026 Tech Lead\",\"createdAt\":\"2023-09-22T09:54:11.769Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2023-09-22T11:17:26.340Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2023-09-22T09:54:17.769Z\",\"description\":\"Dalibor is a full-stack developer but is most active on the front-end. His responsibility is UX / UI design, and he likes coding with SASS. His experience also includes JavaScript, PHP, and Python. Dalibor has a master’s degree in GIS and takes care of cartography and geo health in the team.\\n\\nHis passion is mountains, speleology, and climbing.\",\"locale\":\"en\"}}},\"tagsRel\":{\"data\":[{\"id\":4,\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"cloud\",\"slug\":\"cloud\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-16T07:35:33.113Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-17T13:02:40.219Z\"}},{\"id\":23,\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"maps\",\"slug\":\"maps\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-16T07:35:35.032Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-17T13:02:40.162Z\"}},{\"id\":49,\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"japan\",\"slug\":\"japan\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-16T07:35:41.693Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-17T13:02:39.063Z\"}},{\"id\":43,\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"vector tiles\",\"slug\":\"vector-tiles\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-16T07:35:37.332Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-17T13:02:39.921Z\"}}]},\"localizations\":{\"data\":[]}}},{\"id\":70,\"attributes\":{\"shortName\":\"Maps for Dark mode\",\"slug\":\"2020/05/maps-for-dark-mode\",\"type\":\"article\",\"tags\":\"cloud,maps\",\"date\":\"2020-05-29\",\"description\":\"Are you creating a mobile app or website with dark mode and looking for a map to fit the design? Try Dark and Night maps and create your own!\",\"createdAt\":\"2023-10-04T13:36:19.033Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"