nterest in Python programming and databases. He cares about geodata and how to process them. As a hobby, he assembles and develops sensors for measuring weather conditions. In his free time, he travels and does sports.\",\"locale\":\"en\"}}},\"tagsRel\":{\"data\":[{\"id\":4,\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"cloud\",\"slug\":\"cloud\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-16T07:35:33.113Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-17T13:02:40.219Z\"}},{\"id\":13,\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"data\",\"slug\":\"data\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-16T07:35:34.241Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-17T13:02:40.046Z\"}},{\"id\":23,\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"maps\",\"slug\":\"maps\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-16T07:35:35.032Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-17T13:02:40.162Z\"}},{\"id\":33,\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"openmaptiles\",\"slug\":\"openmaptiles\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-16T07:35:35.714Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-17T13:02:39.995Z\"}},{\"id\":34,\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"openstreetmap\",\"slug\":\"openstreetmap\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-16T07:35:35.734Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-17T13:02:40.014Z\"}}]},\"localizations\":{\"data\":[]}}},{\"id\":35,\"attributes\":{\"shortName\":\"Global terrain basemap for QGIS\",\"slug\":\"2022/02/global-terrain-basemap-for-qgis\",\"type\":\"article\",\"tags\":\"qgis,openstreetmap,terrain,cloud\",\"date\":\"2022-02-22\",\"description\":\"Details of MapTiler QGIS Plugin 3.0 with a global terrain basemap and customizable OpenStreetMap vector tiles.\",\"createdAt\":\"2023-10-03T10:23:05.716Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2023-10-25T11:13:26.744Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2023-10-03T10:23:06.996Z\",\"content\":\"$5c\",\"locale\":\"en\",\"thumbnail\":{\"data\":{\"id\":420,\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"2022-02-22-global-terrain-basemap-for-qgis-1.jpg\",\"alternativeText\":\"Terrain basemap in QGIS\",\"caption\":null,\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080,\"formats\":{\"large\":{\"ext\":\".jpg\",\"url\":\"https://media.maptiler.com/img/large_2022_02_22_global_terrain_basemap_for_qgis_1_51f15cf75a.jpg\",\"hash\":\"large_2022_02_22_global_terrain_basemap_for_qgis_1_51f15cf75a\",\"mime\":\"image/jpeg\",\"name\":\"large_2022-02-22-global-terrain-basemap-for-qgis-1.jpg\",\"path\":null,\"size\":67.64,\"width\":1000,\"height\":563},\"small\":{\"ext\":\".jpg\",\"url\":\"https://media.maptiler.com/img/small_2022_02_22_global_terrain_basemap_for_qgis_1_51f15cf75a.jpg\",\"hash\":\"small_2022_02_22_global_terrain_basemap_for_qgis_1_51f15cf75a\",\"mime\":\"image/jpeg\",\"name\":\"small_2022-02-22-global-terrain-basemap-for-qgis-1.jpg\",\"path\":null,\"size\":23.49,\"width\":500,\"height\":281},\"medium\":{\"ext\":\".jpg\",\"url\":\"https://media.maptiler.com/img/medium_2022_02_22_global_terrain_basemap_for_qgis_1_51f15cf75a.jpg\",\"hash\":\"medium_2022_02_22_global_terrain_basemap_for_qgis_1_51f15cf75a\",\"mime\":\"image/jpeg\",\"name\":\"medium_2022-02-22-global-terrain-basemap-for-qgis-1.jpg\",\"path\":null,\"size\":43.52,\"width\":750,\"height\":422},\"thumbnail\":{\"ext\":\".jpg\",\"url\":\"https://media.maptiler.com/img/thumbnail_2022_02_22_global_terrain_basemap_for_qgis_1_51f15cf75a.jpg\",\"hash\":\"thumbnail_2022_02_22_global_terrain_basemap_for_qgis_1_51f15cf75a\",\"mime\":\"image/jpeg\",\"name\":\"thumbnail_2022-02-22-global-terrain-basemap-for-qgis-1.jpg\",\"path\":null,\"size\":7.68,\"width\":245,\"height\":138}},\"hash\":\"2022_02_22_global_terrain_basemap_for_qgis_1_51f15cf75a\",\"ext\":\".jpg\",\"mime\":\"image/jpeg\",\"size\":189.55,\"url\":\"https://media.maptiler.com/img/2022_02_22_global_terrain_basemap_for_qgis_1_51f15cf75a.jpg\",\"previewUrl\":null,\"provider\":\"aws-s3\",\"provider_metadata\":null,\"createdAt\":\"2023-10-03T10:19:10.826Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-01-15T21:16:07.831Z\"}}},\"newsContent\":[],\"author\":{\"data\":{\"id\":19,\"attributes\":{\"slug\":\"adam-laza\",\"name\":\"Adam Laza\",\"job\":\"Geodata Specialist\",\"createdAt\":\"2023-09-22T11:49:05.458Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2023-10-02T09:01:53.398Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2023-09-22T11:49:06.526Z\",\"description\":\"Adam is a proud member of the Data team. He graduated with excellence in Geoinformatics. During his studies, he participated in Google Summer of Code. Since then, he’s been an enthusiast for open-source and has contributed to several projects. He is always keen on learning new technologies, but he believes there is no problem you couldn’t fix with Python, PostGIS, and enough duct tape.\\n\\nHe loves night rides on his fixed-gear bike and plays Ultimate Frisbee. If there isn’t any tournament on the weekend, you will probably find him hiking in the mountains.\",\"locale\":\"en\"}}},\"tagsRel\":{\"data\":[{\"id\":46,\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"qgis\",\"slug\":\"qgis\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-16T07:35:38.583Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-17T13:02:39.600Z\"}},{\"id\":34,\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"openstreetmap\",\"slug\":\"openstreetmap\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-16T07:35:35.734Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-17T13:02:40.014Z\"}},{\"id\":12,\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"terrain\",\"slug\":\"terrain\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-16T07:35:33.835Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-17T13:02:39.617Z\"}},{\"id\":4,\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"cloud\",\"slug\":\"cloud\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-16T07:35:33.113Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-17T13:02:40.219Z\"}}]},\"localizations\":{\"data\":[]}}},{\"id\":34,\"attributes\":{\"shortName\":\"Maps for game engines\",\"slug\":\"2022/02/maps-for-game-engines\",\"type\":\"article\",\"tags\":\"cloud,maps,press\",\"date\":\"2022-02-28\",\"description\":\"Create the most stunning game environments by modifying real terrain maps of any place on Earth.\",\"createdAt\":\"2023-10-03T10:15:53.616Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-04-05T07:09:07.190Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2023-10-03T10:15:55.023Z\",\"content\":\"$5d\",\"locale\":\"en\",\"thumbnail\":{\"data\":{\"id\":414,\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"2022-01-31-maps-for-game-engines-1.png\",\"alternativeText\":\"Maps for game engines with satellite imagery\",\"caption\":null,\"width\":1600,\"height\":900,\"formats\":{\"large\":{\"ext\":\".png\",\"u